      "widgets_values": [
        "There's a really annoying effect in Qwen 2.1 where even if you change a small part of the image, it seems like the whole image is affected; the colors change, the details are lost, it looks more blurry, etc. The way I managed to mitigate it a bit was by generating the images in 2K, and even then it's still bad."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
